      "title": "Write a general coefficient",
      "body": "<p>Write the complete binomial coefficient of an arbitrary power of x, keeping the numerical powers and the combination factor separate.</p>",
      "recap": "The coefficient includes both the bracket-selection count and the powers of the two numerical coefficients.",
      "pitfall": "Do not omit the constant or highest-power term when setting the index range.",
