    {
      "title": "Check the required prime factors",
      "body": "<p>Factor the divisor into primes. First find which indices guarantee all these factors from the displayed numerical powers; inspect the remaining coefficients with their combination factor included.</p>",
      "recap": "Divisibility depends on the full coefficient, including prime factors supplied by the combination number.",
      "pitfall": "A numerical power missing a factor does not prove the full coefficient is missing it.",
      "pause": "Classify the full index range, check every boundary case and count the qualifying coefficients.",
      "recall": [
